<title>USA: A.M. Best raises Allstate rating to A+.</title>
<headline>A.M. Best raises Allstate rating to A+.</headline>
<dateline>OLDWICK, N.J. 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>A.M. Best Co on Wednesday said it raised its rating on Allstate Insurance Co to &quot;A+&quot; (Superior) from &quot;A&quot; (Excellent).</p>
<p>The rating applies to Allstate and its five reinsured subsidiaries. It is based on their consolidation with a separately rated subsidiary, Allstate Floridian Insurance Co, A.M. Best said.</p>
<p>The upgrade reflects the group's sustainable strong operating performance and substantial catastrophe reduction progress, it said.</p>
</text>
